.TH "NEAT\-SCAN" "1" "2026\-11\-14"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
neat\-scan \- utility program for the NM\-1000 Neat Receipts scanner
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBneat\-scan\fR [\fI\-v\fR] [\fI\-r\fR \fIdpi\fR] [\fI\-g\fR] [\fI\-o\fR \fIout.\&pnm\fR] \fIinfo\fR|\fIprepare\fR|\fIscan\fR|\fIfeed N\fR
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
A command\-line tool to initialize, validate, and scan documents using the
NM\-1000 Neat Receipts scanner.\&
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB\-v\fR
.RS 4
Verbose output
.PP
.RE
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBinfo\fR
.RS 4
Returns the device serial number and paper status
.PP
.RE
\fBscan\fR
.RS 4
Scan a document.\& The document must be against the sensor.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-r\fR \fIdpi\fR
.RS 4
Set the resolution in dots\-per\-inch.\& Valid resolutions are 150, 200, 300,
600.\& Default: 300
.PP
.RE
\fB\-g\fR
.RS 4
Scan in color
.PP
.RE
\fB\-o\fR \fIfilename\fR
.RS 4
The name of the output image file
.PP
.RE
\fBprepare\fR
.RS 4
Initializes the device calibration cache.\& The device will do this
automatically on \fBscan\fR if the calibration files are not present, but
\fBprepare\fR will generate the calibration files without requiring there be
paper in the device.\&
.PP
The calibration files are kept in \fI$HOME/.\&cache/sane\-neat/\fR
.PP
.RE
\fBfeed\fR
.RS 4
Low\-level diagnostic tool to runs the scanner'\&s feed motor forward a number
of steps.\& Used to test the feed reader.\&
.PP
.RE
